<title>USA: IOWA-SO MINN HOGS ACTUAL FRIDAY 95,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>IOWA-SO MINN HOGS ACTUAL FRIDAY 95,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Friday were 95,000 head, compared with the estimate of 100,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Saturday's receipts were 15,000 head, compared with the estimate of 20,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts were steady with midsession Friday.</p>
